{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 1",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-636010617391547046 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=636010617324438182&sectionId=636010617391547046)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggOk0wzDQdA_text","label":"ggOk0wzDQdA_text","default":"Make Your Holiday Gathering More Than Just Dinner"},{"type":"html","id":"gg6T6dKlnFx_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"gg6T6dKlnFx_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/f3359dd7-c0f7-4f2b-a74c-8cec0e2e4a7a.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggCx2cT5hFF_text","label":"ggCx2cT5hFF_text","default":"<p>Holiday gatherings often revolve around one big event: dinner. Everyone comes together, the table gets filled with food, conversations start flowing, and for a few hours, the house feels busier and warmer than usual. But once the plates are cleared, what happens next? Some people reach for their phones, others turn on the television, and the younger ones may disappear into another room. This holiday season, why not give everyone something else to enjoy together? A creative activity like building a brick mosaic can turn the time after dinner into an experience everyone can participate in, giving your gathering another reason to bring people around the same table.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDIizuM6Ew_text","label":"ggDIizuM6Ew_text","default":"The Best Gatherings Keep Going After the Meal"},{"type":"html","id":"ggczZzwDaD6_text","label":"ggczZzwDaD6_text","default":"<p>Dinner may be the main event, but some of the best holiday moments happen afterward. It is the time when people relax, tell stories, share jokes, look through old pictures, or simply enjoy being around each other without having to rush anywhere. Adding a hands on activity can make this part of the evening even more enjoyable. A brick mosaic gives everyone something to work on while conversations continue naturally around the table. Nobody has to stop talking or sit through complicated instructions. People can pick up a few pieces, help with a section, or simply watch the artwork take shape.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggWmUEQj1Us_text","label":"ggWmUEQj1Us_text","default":"Give Everyone a Reason to Put the Phone Down"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiEngawj_e_text","label":"ggiEngawj_e_text","default":"<p>Getting everyone away from their screens during a holiday gathering can be difficult. Even when family members are sitting in the same room, phones can quickly become the center of attention. A shared building project gives everyone a physical reason to look up and participate. Someone can sort the bricks, another person can follow the pattern, and someone else can work on a different section. The activity does not need to compete with conversation because it can happen alongside it. Instead of everyone doing something separately, the group has one simple project they can enjoy together.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggPHw7OOI85_text","label":"ggPHw7OOI85_text","default":"Turn the Table Into a Creative Space"},{"type":"html","id":"gg-sa-tVxgj_text","label":"gg-sa-tVxgj_text","default":"<p>A holiday table does not have to stop being useful once dinner is finished. Clear away the plates, organize a few trays of bricks, and suddenly the same table becomes a creative workspace. This simple change can make the evening feel completely different. Instead of moving immediately to another screen or activity, everyone has an opportunity to stay together and create something. Children can sort pieces by color, teenagers can work on detailed sections, and adults can help organize the larger areas. The project can be as relaxed or as involved as everyone wants it to be.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_label","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_label","default":"Add to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_outOfStockLabel","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_outOfStockLabel","default":"Out Of Stock"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_unavailableLabel","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_unavailableLabel","default":"Unavailable"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_variantSelectionRequiredMessage","default":"Please select a variant to add product to cart"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_successMessage","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_successMessage","default":"Add product to cart successfully"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYsMuOcdEp_errorMessage","label":"ggYsMuOcdEp_errorMessage","default":"Cannot add product to cart"}],
